<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#steel">Glossary</a> · Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Steel</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Steel is an alloy of iron and carbon, much stronger than iron. Steel weapons gave the Spanish an advantage in the conquest of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aztec-empire">Aztec Empire</a>. Accounts of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/german-empire">German Empire</a> discuss German steel production as a measure of industrial power.</p></div>
